# so_forest_contingency: start trigger, teleport hops east through the woods (area_* flag slabs, patrols and dogs),
# firing at what IW4L_AUTOAIM=1 sees at each stop, then the escape trigger.
# Every stop taps +melee every 0.35 s (also while +attack is held): a dog that reaches the player knocks him down
# (dog_combat::meleeBiteAttackPlayer) and dog_melee_death polls MeleeButtonPressed() for a press within
# gs.dog_presstime (375 ms on Regular) of the hint; a hit snaps the dog's neck, a miss lets the bite kill() the player
# through god. A tp during the knock-down waits for the script to unlink the player. The stop after second_dog
# (where the second dog usually lands) takes knockdown_NN screenshots.
wait world; spawn 0; god; wait 2s
tp -28544 -8500 840 0 0; wait 2s; screenshot start
tp -28045 -8179 1000 0 0; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; hold +attack; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; release +attack; give ammo; press +reload; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s; press +melee 0.1; wait 0.35s
